{
  "bookId": "hero-215006",
  "id": "bond-29318",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29318001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "嗯，这下可难办了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "都督有何烦恼？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "你有所不知，我曾欠下孔明一个人情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "不久前和他再度碰面，不知怎么被提起这件事来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "他就提出一个让我十分头痛的要求，而我碍于曾经欠下的人情没办法拒绝。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以究竟是什么要求？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "种菜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29318009",
              "text": "我没听错吧？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29318009",
              "text": "他在整你吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29318008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "不排除这是孔明的恶作剧，不过我既然应承下来，就没有理由放弃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "我看你家中的阳台有诸多的植被，想必你很擅长此道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "不如和我一道去为孔明种菜，如何？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那要先看看种什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29318013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "好说，一些茄子、葫芦和毛豆之类的家常小菜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
